{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2022-06-22 06:00:00', 'title': 'SEMPRA INFRASTRUCTURE AND INEOS ENERGY TRADING SIGN HEADS OF AGREEMENT FOR LNG SUPPLY', 'text': "HOUSTON , JUNE 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SEMPRA INFRASTRUCTURE, A SUBSIDIARY OF SEMPRA\xa0(NYSE: SRE) (BMV: SRE),\xa0AND INEOS ENERGY TRADING LTD., A SUBSIDIARY OF INEOS, A GLOBAL CHEMICAL PRODUCTS MANUFACTURER, TODAY ANNOUNCED THEY HAVE ENTERED INTO A HEADS OF AGREEMENT (HOA) FOR THE LONG-TERM SUPPLY OF LIQUEFIED NATURAL GAS (LNG) FROM SEMPRA INFRASTRUCTURE'S GULF COAST LNG PORTFOLIO OF PROJECTS UNDER DEVELOPMENT IN NORTH AMERICA."}